text:
{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "land on his shoulders instead of the counter",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "the whole of it had taken less time than the arguing usually took",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "and became a merchant",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "that was the honest whole of his pricing",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Nothing came after it. Nothing came beside it.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Are you buying or praying?",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Something had gone over.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "in this pass of the day nobody had put a heel through it",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "did not hear the first of the joists go above them",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "I have priced it. That is the price.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Silas Marrow, junior appraiser, Corvessa house",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "like a man carrying a roof",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "worth eleven pence as a book and nothing as anything else",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "He took the metals and left the cloth.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "the sound had not been large",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "That was the shape of the mercy on offer.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "He wanted one thing that behaved.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "fire shortens a thing, and this was not shorter",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "His arithmetic was not the problem.",
      "kind": "quip"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "A good one only got heavier.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "The Road counted that as a debt too, and priced it worse.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "His shoulders kept the shape of the straps.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "because sometimes they moved while you watched.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "gate-keys on a ring he never seemed to use,",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "The book doesn't.",
      "kind": "banter"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "like a word from someone else's language.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "It did not slosh. It did not knock.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "The board says sealed cargo: subject to inspection.",
      "kind": "banter"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "spent here, standing on cold stone, arguing about wax.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "It was not pain.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "is only borrowing somebody else's.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Not by much. By one.",
      "kind": "undercut"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "No." Wren blew on the ink. "Nothing.",
      "kind": "banter"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "MP ?/? | Gold ?",
      "kind": "system_voice"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "the knee looked like a thing that had been argued with and won",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "That's not a carry, that's a wager.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Everyone's got a cousin who did it the once.",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Did the once and what?",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "the shoulder that still worked",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "The bonus did not send you fast. It sent you alone.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "at about the pace of a funeral",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "some week he'd never be introduced to, folded away",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Four the wrong way.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "a thin man who wanted to be asleep",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Not many get that.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "laughed once, which hurt his chest, and then stopped",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[STATUS] wren — Level 2 | HP 13/22 | MP ?/? | Gold ?",
      "kind": "system_voice"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "I'm not a gate, I'm a man with a stamp",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "There's a mouse in there I've named",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Which is the same thing said slower",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "He said it without heat",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "His breath had gone from a rattle to something with a whistle",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "which was its own kind of decency",
      "kind": "undercut"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "MP ?/? | Gold ?",
      "kind": "system_voice"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "I had an hour with a mouse.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "counting sacks off a boat for a while, which he'll find restful",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "because I'm the window and he's a man with a stamp",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "That's three hundred and forty-one days.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Haro's face did not do anything at all.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Paid's gone up,",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Owed hasn't moved.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Something,",
      "kind": "absurd"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[STATUS] wren — Level 2 | HP 15/22 | MP ?/? | Gold ?",
      "kind": "system_voice"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "like a man carrying an egg",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "It's warmer out here. That's not a joke",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "\"Then it's short one.\" The clerk stamped it anyway, thirty",
      "kind": "undercut"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Days don't go anywhere, porter. That's the whole of the bookkeeping.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Then it's just a hole.",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[STATUS] wren — Level 2 | HP 17/22 | MP ?/? | Gold ?",
      "kind": "system_voice"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "beats": [
    {
      "anchor": "Look at your book.  Look at your margin.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "still hadn't learned to stop hoping against",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "he had heard of the way you hear of a flood",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Four miles and whatever the window feels like",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "stopped doing it, which told Wren what her remaining was",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "had days the way nineteen-year-olds have days",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "That's what I paid for. Not the answer. The wording.",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "for less time than it deserved",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "told him what it always told him, flatly, without weight",
      "kind": "quip"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "standing still cost three at dawn and he did not have",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "not how a man carries and not how a man survives carrying",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "Not rain — rain would have been a kindness —",
      "kind": "undercut"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "at a speed that was not walking",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "this is where they don't say what happened to the ones",
      "kind": "deadpan"
    }
  ]
}
